    website: "https://roninforge.org"
abstract: >-
  RoninForge goei-sync is a command-line reader for Claude Code session logs
  that prints your spend broken down by git branch in one command, and can sync
  daily rollups to Goei by RoninForge, the hosted team cost dashboard. It reads
  the logs Claude Code already writes to disk and never touches API traffic. It
  is MIT licensed, runs entirely on your machine, and requires no API keys.
